-- Imported verbatim from the Luau conformance suite (luau-lang/luau),
-- tests/conformance/gc.luau at commit 86d2a9d.
-- See README.md and LICENSE in this directory for provenance and licensing.
--
-- conformance: out-of-scope: metatable-events
-- This chunk contains only gc.luau checks that currently fail in Waluau.
-- This is a documented deliberate difference, not scheduled work; see DEVIATIONS.md.
--
-- Split from conformance/luau/gc.walu. Common setup is repeated as needed
-- so each numbered chunk is independently discoverable by the conformance runner.

lim = 15

-- shrinking tables reduce their capacity; confirming the shrinking is difficult but we can at least test the surface level behavior
a = {}; setmetatable(a, {__mode = 'ks'})
for i=1,lim do a[{}] = i end
collectgarbage()
assert(next(a) == nil)
